SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Front Row to Boston Sports
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 44 spots l
 eft\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.co
 m/events/205640\n\n5:00PM Reception 5:30PM Discussion\n\nCalling all Bosto
 n sports fans! Join us for an evening of legendary stories\, unforgettable
  moments\, and plenty of perspective from the people who had a front-row s
 eat to it all. Taking their growing local sports podcast\, The Front Row t
 o Boston Sports\, to the stage at The ’Quin\, Bob Lobel\, former sportsc
 aster for WBZ-TV\, Bob Ryan\, sportswriter formerly with The Boston Globe\
 , and Mike Lynch\, WCVB sports anchor\, come together to look back on the 
 teams\, personalities\, triumphs\, and heartbreaks that have defined gener
 ations of Boston sports.\n\nCollectively\, the panel has spent decades cov
 ering the Celtics\, Patriots\, Red Sox\, and Bruins from press boxes\, sid
 elines\, studios\, locker rooms\, and championship celebrations. From Larr
 y Bird’s Celtics and unforgettable seasons at Fenway to the rise of the 
 Patriots and countless moments on the ice at the Garden\, they will share 
 the stories behind the headlines—and perhaps a few that never made it in
 to print or onto the air.\n\nExpect an evening filled with candid memories
 \, lively debate\, and the unmistakable passion that comes with talking sp
 orts in Boston. Whether you have followed these teams for decades or simpl
 y love a great sports story\, consider this your seat in the front row.\n\
 n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary
  light bites and beverages will be served. We kindly ask that all cancella
 tions be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205640
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
END:VEVENT
