 ted but also available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be aware that we will o
 ffer a photo opportunity on these evenings\; however\, the regular Photo P
 olicy will otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those who do not comply wi
 th the Privacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Clubhouse in keeping w
 ith the standards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted professional photog
